  "articleBody": "Start an interior remodeling project by defining how the space must function, documenting existing conditions, setting a realistic scope, and selecting materials before construction. Then confirm design responsibilities, permit needs, trade coordination, payment terms, and change procedures in writing so the finished work reflects both your household priorities and the home’s physical limits.",
